AntiParkingLot — Prompt Parking Lot for Antigravity
Repository: https://github.com/jmbreckel/AnitParkingLot.git

An Antigravity Plugin + Side-Pane MCP App for capturing follow-up ideas (text or voice)
while Antigravity is busy working—without interrupting active runs—and sending them when ready.

Quick Install (Global on Antigravity):
  git clone https://github.com/jmbreckel/AnitParkingLot.git AntiParkingLot
  cd AntiParkingLot
  npm run install:global

Install Options:
  npm run install:global                 # Zero-copy registration in ~/.gemini/config/plugins.json
  npm run install:global -- --mode=link  # Junction/symlink in ~/.gemini/config/plugins/anti-parking-lot
  npm run install:global -- --mode=copy  # Standalone copy in ~/.gemini/config/plugins/anti-parking-lot
  npm run uninstall:global               # Remove global install (preserves saved data)

Data Storage:
  ~/.gemini/config/plugin-data/anti-parking-lot/parking_lot.json

Documentation:
  - README.md                        Full project overview
  - documentation/installation.md    Detailed install, update, and troubleshooting guide
  - documentation/user-guide.md      Day-to-day workflow and shortcuts
  - documentation/architecture.md    System design and discovery pipeline
  - documentation/mcp-reference.md   MCP tools and storage schema
  - instruction.md                   Conversation workflow reference
